CLIProxyAPI: add JSON passthrough through credential selection and usage.

Keep validated grouped configuration, keyed synthesis, alias resolution and
management indexes independent of chat compatibility. Add a raw client route,
executor and internal-only model registration using native selection, cooldown
and per-client usage reporting. Isolate both route and executor protocols.
Applied after key-allowlist and zai-tool-shims with --fuzz=0.
Rationale: packages/cliproxyapi/docs/cliproxyapi-passthrough.md.

